    '{"dog":"safe","cat":"safe","horse":"safe","bird":"safe","rabbit":"moderation"}', 'Safe and healthy crunchy treat when deseeded and cored.', 'Rich in vitamin C, vitamin A, dietary fiber, and pectin.', 'Seeds contain amygdalin (cyanide); cores pose choking hazards.',
    'None when seeds and core are removed; digestive upset if fed in excess.', 'Slice into bite-sized wedges and discard core and seeds.', '["Carrots","Watermelon","Cantaloupe"]', '["carrots","watermelon"]',
