    '{"dog":"safe","cat":"safe","horse":"safe","bird":"safe","rabbit":"moderation"}', 'Excellent low-calorie, high-fiber crunchy snack for dogs, horses, and small pets.', 'Beta-carotene (vitamin A precursor), potassium, fiber, and supports dental hygiene.', 'High in natural sugars; rabbits should receive only small training coins.',
