    '{"dog":"safe","cat":"safe","ferret":"safe","bird":"moderation","rabbit":"unsafe"}', 'Outstanding lean protein source for dogs, cats, and ferrets when boiled plain.', 'High biological value protein, amino acids, phosphorus, and niacin.', 'Cooked bones splinter and perforate intestines. Onions or garlic seasoning are toxic.',
    'None when fed plain; gastrointestinal perforation if bones are ingested.', 'Never feed cooked bones. Remove skin and prepare without salt, garlic, or onion powder.', '["Cooked turkey breast","Plain boiled white fish"]', '["salmon","eggs"]',
